  "releaseNotes": "20260522.0.0 - Telemetry Manifest Handle Maps. Enriches manifest.json with class_handle_map and interaction_handle_map so telemetry consumers can resolve runtime class handles, and bumps telemetry manifest compatibility to 1.1.\n\n20260513.0.0 - HLA compliance, RTI shutdown & federation lifecycle. Implements HLA-compliant RTI shutdown (PORT-HANDLING-4), enhanced federation lifecycle, Save/Restore compliance, and MockRti lost-federate recovery.\n\n20260504.0.0 - RTI Console exit/quit shortcut. Adds `q` as a shorthand alias for `exit`/`quit` in the RTI Console.\n\n20260503.0.0 - Group Chat DDM and error observability.\n\n20260429.0.0 - Telemetry Phase 1 completion. Aligns the admin client SDK with the telemetry-enabled RTI/server stack and the Phase 1 packaging baseline.",
